---
import ArticleLayout from '../../layouts/ArticleLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../../config/site';
import { monetizationConfig } from '../../config/monetization';
---

<ArticleLayout
  title="Affiliate & Monetization Disclosure"
  metaTitle={`FTC Affiliate & Monetization Disclosure | ${siteConfig.name}`}
  metaDescription={`Transparent FTC 16 CFR Part 255 disclosure regarding retailer links and future affiliate partnerships on ${siteConfig.name}.`}
  pathname="/affiliate-disclosure/"
  breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Affiliate Disclosure', href: '/affiliate-disclosure/' }]}
>
  <p>
    <strong>Last Updated:</strong> {siteConfig.lastUpdatedDefault}
  </p>

  <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-brand-50 dark:bg-slate-900 border border-brand-200 dark:border-slate-800 font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">
    {monetizationConfig.affiliateDisclosureShort}
  </div>

  {monetizationConfig.affiliateEnabled ? (
    <>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">
        1. FTC Compliance (16 CFR Part 255)
      </h2>
      <p>
        In accordance with the Federal Trade Commission's 16 CFR Part 255 ("Guides Concerning the Use of Endorsements and Testimonials in Advertising"), <strong>{siteConfig.name}</strong> discloses that outbound product links in our calculator shopping lists routed through <code>/go/</code> may be affiliate referral links. If you click one of these links and make a qualifying purchase at a partner retailer, we may receive a referral commission at <strong>zero additional cost to you</strong>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">
        2. Retail Affiliate Program Participation
      </h2>
      <p>
        Where active, {siteConfig.legalName} earns referral fees solely from qualifying purchases through properly tagged partner links (such as Amazon Associates and/or Impact/retailer networks) only after formal program approval.
      </p>
    </>
  ) : (
    <>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">
        1. Current Pre-Affiliate Status
      </h2>
      <p>
        At this time, <strong>{siteConfig.name}</strong> has not activated any paid affiliate programs (including Amazon Associates or Impact/Home Depot affiliate links), and affiliate buy buttons are disabled across all calculators. We receive zero commissions or referral fees from any retailer or brand.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">
        2. Planned Future Disclosures (FTC 16 CFR Part 255)
      </h2>
      <p>
        If {siteConfig.legalName} is approved for and enables affiliate partnerships in the future, this disclosure and every tagged outbound link (<code>rel="sponsored nofollow noopener"</code>) will be updated prior to activation in accordance with FTC 16 CFR Part 255 rules.
      </p>
    </>
  )}

  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">
    3. Editorial Independence
  </h2>
  <p>
    Retail pricing benchmarks and external links never influence our mathematical formulas, coverage rate defaults, or quantity calculations. You can edit any unit price or coverage rate in any calculator, and all tools remain 100% free to use.
  </p>
</ArticleLayout>
